# No environment variables required for basic operation.
#
# Adaptive Router uses AI workers via their local CLI tools (existing subscription
# sign-ins) — no API keys are required by default.
#
# If you want to configure optional behavior via environment variables in the future,
# this file will document them. For now, all configuration is in workers.json.
#
# See README.md for setup instructions.

# Optional configuration via environment variables:

# Override the dashboard port (default: 3210)
# PORT=3210

# Pre-set a fixed 64-char hex bearer token for the ChatGPT / MCP connector.
# If unset, Adaptive Router generates a token on first run and saves it to
# .router/connector-token.json (never in tracked configuration files).
# AR_CONNECTOR_TOKEN=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef

# Optional: Path to benchmark lab directory for regression runs
# AR_BENCHMARK_LAB_ROOT=./benchmark-lab
